{
  "name": "Stalled deal reminder to the owner",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "f5c6986d-9fee-528e-8193-8ead4f044903",
      "name": "Schedule",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "raw",
        "jsonOutput": "{\n  \"config\": {\n    \"sheet_url\": \"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit\",\n    \"sheet_tab\": \"Deals\",\n    \"owner_email\": \"you@example.com\",\n    \"business_name\": \"Your Business\",\n    \"sender_name\": \"Your Name\"\n  }\n}",
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b463f995-cd9c-5772-a29d-9a1a7057436b",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_url }}"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.sheet_tab }}"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "ead977e9-6a58-57e6-9f93-9d8e5e927816",
      "name": "Read rows",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.7,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const daysSince = (v) => { const t = Date.parse(v); return isNaN(t) ? null : (Date.now() - t) / 86400000; };\nconst daysUntil = (v) => { const t = Date.parse(v); return isNaN(t) ? null : (t - Date.now()) / 86400000; };\nconst has = (v) => v !== undefined && v !== null && String(v).trim() !== '';\nconst cfg = $('Settings').first().json.config;\nreturn $input.all().filter((item) => {\n  const r = item.json;\n  return (String(r.status).toLowerCase() === 'open' && daysSince(r.last_activity_date) !== null && daysSince(r.last_activity_date) >= 7);\n}).slice(0, 50);"
      },
      "id": "0393f999-a8b9-5d9d-a174-86176c9beecc",
      "name": "Find rows to act on",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.config.owner_email }}",
        "subject": "=Stalled deal: {{ $json.deal }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "={{ $json.deal }} with {{ $json.contact }} is in stage '{{ $json.stage }}' (value {{ $json.value }}) and has had no activity since {{ $json.last_activity_date }}.\n\nSend a follow-up today.",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "id": "1b1e948f-6eea-5d5f-a033-aa78993959fe",
      "name": "Send email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        960,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stalled deal reminder to the owner\nEvery morning emails you the deals that have not moved for 7 days so nothing goes cold.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "0df1a7bd-a8ec-542f-b969-32fc95698d99",
      "name": "Note: what this does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Use a Google Sheet with a tab named **Deals** and these headers in row 1: see `sheet-headers.csv`.\n2. Open **Settings** and fill in your sheet URL, your email and names.\n3. Connect Google Sheets and Gmail on the nodes with warnings.\n4. Check the rule in **Find rows to act on** (it shows exactly which rows get an email) and the wording in **Send email**.\n5. Run it once by hand with a test row, then switch the workflow to **Active**.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "07e8ce54-1bf9-5f65-b074-5a1a77517d1c",
      "name": "Note: setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
